  "caveat": "The store records a mega that HAPPENED. It cannot record a mega that was CONSIDERED and held, nor one whose body fainted before it could be spent (Will, 2026-08-06: \"how many of the raichus and all these megas died before they could evolve?\"). So the turn-share is a distribution over EXECUTED megas and is a LOWER bound on how often the decision was actually faced. Anything fitted on it inherits that censoring."
